---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="About" description="Meet Fran Legacy and learn how we approach creative real estate investing, development, and rental strategy in Raleigh, NC.">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-media"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-shade"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> About Fran Legacy</p>
      <h1>Real estate solutions with a <em>longer horizon.</em></h1>
      <p>We bring investors, wholesalers, lenders, and properties together around thoughtful structures built to work in the real world.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-split">
    <div><p class="section-kicker">Our approach</p><h2>Find the structure that makes the deal <em>make sense.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="prose-stack">
      <p>Fran Legacy is a Raleigh-based real estate investment, development, and consulting company focused on single-family and multifamily opportunities.</p>
      <p>We evaluate traditional acquisitions alongside creative structures such as subject-to and seller financing. After acquisition, we look for the operating strategy that best serves the property, from short- and mid-term stays to co-living and long-term rental models.</p>
      <p>The aim is simple: improve the asset, create useful housing, and build durable value for the people involved.</p>
      <a class="button button-dark inline-button" href="/contact">Talk through your goals <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founder-section">
    <div class="founder-photo"><img src="/images/thomas-francisco.jpg" alt="Thomas Francisco of Fran Legacy" /></div>
    <div class="founder-copy">
      <p class="section-kicker light">The person behind the work</p>
      <h2>Meet Thomas Francisco.</h2>
      <p>Thomas founded Fran Legacy to help people move from real estate interest to informed action. His work connects deal analysis, creative finance, property improvement, and rental operations into one practical conversation.</p>
      <blockquote>“The best strategy is the one everyone understands and can confidently execute.”</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-band">
    <p class="section-kicker">What we bring together</p>
    <div class="service-list">
      <span>Acquisitions</span><span>Creative finance</span><span>Development</span><span>Rental strategy</span><span>Investor guidance</span><span>Deal funding</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
